# IBM Content Manager Export Configuration File
# Format: <export_name> <base_folder> <itemtype>
# Each line represents one itemtype export with its own name and folder
#
# Examples:

# Linux paths
007ClientesFacRI /backup/007_Clientes_Fac_RI V03206007002D
007ClientesConstruya /backup/007_Clientes_Construya V03206007003D

# Windows paths (uncomment for Windows)
# 007ClientesFacRI G:\007_Clientes_Fac_RI V03206007002D
# 007ClientesConstruya G:\007_Clientes_Construya V03206007003D
